# glx3_2 is one batch of eight 4-chip blocks at once (2026-11-28 10:27Z) on the build that floors omega at 1e-6 in
# fp32 (b79fa38: the divergence fix on the landing stack), from the eight starts of glx1. All eight end, the start
# U x (1 + 1e-7) included. The new floor moves the rounding of every fp32 run from iteration 2, so these states
# differ from glx1's by design; they are the reference states of the build from here on.
